		<summary type="html"><![CDATA[<p>plpgsql is better for SQL-heavy tasks as it supports plan caching, making it faster for such operations. plpython3u is great for tasks needing <a href="https://syntaxscenarios.com/category/python/" rel="nofollow">Python </a>libraries or complex computations, but it&#039;s slower for SQL since it uses the SPI interface. Choose based on your task needs!</p>]]></summary>
